			<color>(112,89,43)</color>
		</stuffProps>
	</ThingDef>
	
	<ThingDef ParentName="ResourceBase">
		<defName>TSOA_AnimaSap</defName>
		<label>anima sap</label>
		<description>Viscous, dimly glowing sap tapped from an anima tree. Unprotected contact with it produces the unsettling feeling of closeness with something far larger and more powerful than oneself. It seems to store a great deal of psychic energy which, properly harnessed, can be used for powerful crafts and rituals.</description>
