	</ThingDef>
	
	<ThingDef ParentName="ResourceBase">
		<defName>TSOA_AnimaAmber</defName>
		<label>anima amber</label>
		<description>Crystallized anima sap, distilled and purified into a gemstone that glows with inner power. Like the anima tree itself, it thrums with a psychic resonance that is not heard, but felt like a pressure on the mind. Its immense power can fuel the mightiest of crafts and rituals.</description>
