	<ThingDef ParentName="ResourceBase">
		<defName>TSOA_AnimaPearl</defName>
		<label>anima pearl</label>
		<description>A lustrous pearl, grown from an anima tree and infused with life essence from a willing human. When planted in the ground, forms a new anima tree. Oddly, it doesn't seem to grow from the pearl itself. Maybe the pearl calls it up from deeper within the planet?</description>
